cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Vault Analyser"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Vault Analyser is a cross-platform desktop application for documenting and
  analysing medieval vaulted ceilings from 3D point cloud scans. It combines
  AI-driven segmentation of vault ribs and boss stones (SAM 3) with automated
  2D plan analysis (bay proportions, starcut and circlecut matching, bay-plan
  reconstruction) and 3D intrados tracing and best-fit arc measurement.
